{{!-- Renders the byline sub-label under a contributor's name.

     Three tiers, in precedence order:

       1. The nine people on the About page (Team + Editorial Board)
          get their specific role.
       2. The contributing writers announced 2026-09-21 get
          "Contributing Writer". This list is the same one rendered as
          the top section of custom-contributors.hbs and the two must
          be kept in step.
       3. Everyone else falls through to "New Contributor" (exactly one
          published essay) or the generic "Contributor" label, the
          latter guarded by {{#if description}} so tags with no bio
          don't get a naked sub-label.

     Ghost's match helper has no regex operator and no list membership
     test, so tier 2 is an explicit {{else}} chain like tier 1.

     Expects to be called inside a {{#foreach tags}} scope so `slug`
     and `description` resolve to the current tag. --}}
{{#match slug "author-jake-meador"}}<div class="meta-author-sub">Editor-in-Chief</div>
{{else}}{{#match slug "author-mark-kremer"}}<div class="meta-author-sub">Executive Director</div>
{{else}}{{#match slug "author-ian-harber"}}<div class="meta-author-sub">Director of Communications</div>
{{else}}{{#match slug "author-nadya-williams"}}<div class="meta-author-sub">Managing Editor</div>
{{else}}{{#match slug "author-samuel-james"}}<div class="meta-author-sub">Editorial Board Member</div>
{{else}}{{#match slug "author-kirsten-sanders"}}<div class="meta-author-sub">Editorial Board Member</div>
{{else}}{{#match slug "author-matthew-loftus"}}<div class="meta-author-sub">Editorial Board Member</div>
{{else}}{{#match slug "author-susannah-black-roberts"}}<div class="meta-author-sub">Editorial Board Member</div>
{{else}}{{#match slug "author-tessa-carman"}}<div class="meta-author-sub">Editorial Board Member</div>
{{else}}{{#match slug "author-haley-byrd-wilt"}}<div class="meta-author-sub">Contributing Writer</div>
{{else}}{{#match slug "author-katelyn-walls-shelton"}}<div class="meta-author-sub">Contributing Writer</div>
{{else}}{{#match slug "author-hayden-nesbit"}}<div class="meta-author-sub">Contributing Writer</div>
